# Agent Sprite Forge (this repository)

This checkout is the Agent Sprite Forge plugin. For 2D sprites, maps, prop packs, or video-to-sprite:

- Read `AGENTS.md` and the matching file under `skills/*/SKILL.md`.
- Generate raw art with the host image tool. Do not draw requested art in code.
- Postprocess with `python scripts/forge.py` (see `python scripts/forge.py --help`).
- Use [docs/agent-runtime.md](docs/agent-runtime.md) for Cursor / Grok / Codex tool names.
- `video2dsprite` needs `image_to_video`; otherwise use `generate2dsprite`.
